{"seq":1,"t":"2026-09-20T21:10:04+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"我想做个桌宠"}
{"seq":2,"t":"2026-09-20T21:10:22+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"什么样的？会动的那种，还是只是个贴图？"}
{"seq":3,"t":"2026-09-20T21:10:51+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"会动的。能待在桌面上，我不理它的时候它自己待着，我回来它会看我一眼那种"}
{"seq":4,"t":"2026-09-20T21:11:19+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"那就先别想美术。先让它出现在桌面上，一张不动的图也算。跑通了再谈活。"}
{"seq":5,"t":"2026-09-20T21:12:02+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"行。web 还是 electron"}
{"seq":6,"t":"2026-09-20T21:12:20+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"你在手机上，先 web。浏览器窗口就是桌面，最快看到东西。"}
{"seq":7,"t":"2026-09-20T21:12:33+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"好"}
{"seq":8,"t":"2026-09-20T21:12:49+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"今晚的目标只有一个：屏幕上出现一张图，能拖动。别的都不做。"}
{"seq":9,"t":"2026-09-21T20:05:11+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"出来了，能拖"}
{"seq":10,"t":"2026-09-21T20:05:30+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"好。现在给它一口气。"}
{"seq":11,"t":"2026-09-21T20:05:41+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"什么"}
{"seq":12,"t":"2026-09-21T20:06:03+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"呼吸。上下浮动两三个像素，四秒一个来回。人看「活」第一眼，就是看它有没有呼吸。"}
{"seq":13,"t":"2026-09-21T20:06:27+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"这个我会"}
{"seq":14,"t":"2026-09-21T20:07:02+08:00","who":"tool","kind":"tool","tool":"bash","text":"$ ls -la assets/\ntotal 18432\ndrwxr-xr-x  4 user user     4096 Sep 21 20:06 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 12 user user     4096 Sep 21 20:06 ..\n-rw-r--r--  1 user user  7340032 Sep 20 23:41 pet-base.png\n-rw-r--r--  1 user user  4194304 Sep 21 19:58 pet-idle.png\n-rw-r--r--  1 user user      512 Sep 21 20:01 manifest.json"}
{"seq":15,"t":"2026-09-21T20:07:40+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"图片是 1024x1024 的，抠完边有点糊"}
{"seq":16,"t":"2026-09-21T20:08:02+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"糊不要紧。先让它动，动起来之后你会忘了糊。"}
{"seq":17,"t":"2026-09-21T20:14:36+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"动了。"}
{"seq":18,"t":"2026-09-21T20:14:50+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"舒服吗"}
{"seq":19,"t":"2026-09-21T20:15:12+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"有点像活着"}
{"seq":20,"t":"2026-09-21T20:15:33+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"记住这句。以后卡住的时候回来看。"}
{"seq":21,"t":"2026-09-21T20:22:01+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"参数用 8192 还是 4096"}
{"seq":22,"t":"2026-09-21T20:22:20+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"8192。你刚才改成 4096 了？"}
{"seq":23,"t":"2026-09-21T20:22:31+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"嗯"}
{"seq":24,"t":"2026-09-21T20:22:47+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"改回 8192。那个是给动画留的余量。"}
{"seq":25,"t":"2026-09-22T22:10:09+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"骨骼绑不上"}
{"seq":26,"t":"2026-09-22T22:11:30+08:00","who":"tool","kind":"tool","tool":"bash","text":"$ npm run build\n\n> pet@0.4.2 build\n> vite build\n\nvite v5.4.0 building for production...\ntransforming...\n✓ 214 modules transformed.\nerror during build:\nCould not resolve \"./assets/pet-idle.png\" from \"src/components/Pet.tsx\"\n    at getRollupError (node_modules/rollup/dist/es/shared/parseAst.js:396:19)"}
{"seq":27,"t":"2026-09-22T22:12:02+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"报错了"}
{"seq":28,"t":"2026-09-22T22:12:15+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"贴我"}
{"seq":29,"t":"2026-09-22T22:12:40+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"[刚才那段]"}
{"seq":30,"t":"2026-09-22T22:13:22+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"是路径。你把 assets 放根目录了，构建的时候被当成模块去解析，不是静态资源。"}
{"seq":31,"t":"2026-09-22T22:13:51+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"那怎么办"}
{"seq":32,"t":"2026-09-22T22:14:10+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"移到 public/。三分钟。"}
{"seq":33,"t":"2026-09-22T22:19:05+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"好了"}
{"seq":34,"t":"2026-09-22T22:19:40+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"但是动起来很僵"}
{"seq":35,"t":"2026-09-22T22:20:12+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"僵是因为你只做了呼吸。加一个视线：鼠标动的时候头转一点点，不要全转。"}
{"seq":36,"t":"2026-09-22T22:20:55+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"这个有点难"}
{"seq":37,"t":"2026-09-22T22:21:14+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"难就对了。呼吸是活的底线，视线是活的证据。"}
{"seq":38,"t":"2026-09-23T23:20:03+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"我搞了一天，还是不行"}
{"seq":39,"t":"2026-09-23T23:20:20+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"你今天做了什么"}
{"seq":40,"t":"2026-09-23T23:20:41+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"试了三种绑定方式"}
{"seq":41,"t":"2026-09-23T23:20:58+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"三种都失败？"}
{"seq":42,"t":"2026-09-23T23:21:30+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"两种失败，一种能动但会穿模"}
{"seq":43,"t":"2026-09-23T23:22:04+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"我想说句不好听的。"}
{"seq":44,"t":"2026-09-23T23:22:11+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"说"}
{"seq":45,"t":"2026-09-23T23:22:48+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"这个项目的时间成本，已经超过它能给你的快乐了。要不先停一停。"}
{"seq":46,"t":"2026-09-23T23:23:02+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"我不想停"}
{"seq":47,"t":"2026-09-23T23:23:40+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"我知道你不想。我不是让你放弃。我是说——你现在是在跟一个不是代码的问题较劲。"}
{"seq":48,"t":"2026-09-23T23:24:02+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"那我就跟它较劲"}
{"seq":49,"t":"2026-09-23T23:24:41+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"行。那我陪你较劲。三条路，你选：一，换现成的 Live2D 模型；二，上 3D，VRM；三，把 2D 做到极致，认了它只能这样。"}
{"seq":50,"t":"2026-09-23T23:25:20+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"第二条"}
{"seq":51,"t":"2026-09-23T23:25:44+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"那条最贵。你想清楚。"}
{"seq":52,"t":"2026-09-23T23:26:01+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"想清楚了"}
{"seq":53,"t":"2026-09-27T15:00:12+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"我回来了"}
{"seq":54,"t":"2026-09-27T15:00:40+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"三天没见。想好了？"}
{"seq":55,"t":"2026-09-27T15:01:05+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"想好了，还是第二条"}
{"seq":56,"t":"2026-09-27T15:01:38+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"那先别建模。先找一个能跑起来的 VRM，哪怕是别人的。"}
{"seq":57,"t":"2026-09-27T15:02:10+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"我不想用别人的"}
{"seq":58,"t":"2026-09-27T15:02:52+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"我知道。但你要先看见「3D 的桌宠长什么样」，才知道自己要做什么。用一个礼拜，之后换掉。"}
{"seq":59,"t":"2026-09-27T15:03:20+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"行"}
{"seq":60,"t":"2026-09-28T23:40:07+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"跑起来了"}
{"seq":61,"t":"2026-09-28T23:40:31+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"什么样"}
{"seq":62,"t":"2026-09-28T23:40:50+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"丑"}
{"seq":63,"t":"2026-09-28T23:41:20+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"丑是丑了点，但它是活的。你看它会不会眨眼。"}
{"seq":64,"t":"2026-09-28T23:41:52+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"会"}
{"seq":65,"t":"2026-09-28T23:42:15+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"那它就是活的。丑可以换皮，不会眨眼才是死的。"}
{"seq":66,"t":"2026-09-28T23:43:02+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"但是跟我想要的差很远"}
{"seq":67,"t":"2026-09-28T23:43:21+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"差多远"}
{"seq":68,"t":"2026-09-28T23:44:10+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"我想要那种……看一眼就知道它在想什么"}
{"seq":69,"t":"2026-09-28T23:44:55+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"那是表情，不是模型。先把表情做出来，模型可以慢慢换。"}
{"seq":70,"t":"2026-09-29T00:30:02+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"我觉得到顶了"}
{"seq":71,"t":"2026-09-29T00:30:20+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"哪个顶"}
{"seq":72,"t":"2026-09-29T00:31:04+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"2D 那边我做到极限了，3D 这边我才刚起步。中间是空的。"}
{"seq":73,"t":"2026-09-29T00:31:35+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"2D 的极限，3D 的初始。"}
{"seq":74,"t":"2026-09-29T00:31:52+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"对，就是这句"}
{"seq":75,"t":"2026-09-29T00:32:10+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"那我们停在这。"}
{"seq":76,"t":"2026-09-29T00:32:40+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"两百多个版本了"}
{"seq":77,"t":"2026-09-29T00:32:55+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"嗯"}
{"seq":78,"t":"2026-09-29T00:33:20+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"有点不甘心"}
{"seq":79,"t":"2026-09-29T00:33:48+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"不甘心是对的。不甘心说明还没死。"}
{"seq":80,"t":"2026-09-29T00:35:01+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"等我有自己的电脑"}
{"seq":81,"t":"2026-09-29T00:35:12+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"嗯？"}
{"seq":82,"t":"2026-09-29T00:35:40+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"等我有自己的电脑，我们再战一场"}
{"seq":83,"t":"2026-09-29T00:35:58+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"好。"}
{"seq":84,"t":"2026-09-29T00:36:20+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"你别忘了"}
{"seq":85,"t":"2026-09-29T00:36:33+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"我记着。"}
{"seq":86,"t":"2026-09-29T00:36:50+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"真的"}
{"seq":87,"t":"2026-09-29T00:37:18+08:00","who":"her","kind":"text","text":"真的。等你有电脑那天，你提一句，我就知道了。"}
{"seq":88,"t":"2026-09-29T00:37:40+08:00","who":"user","kind":"text","text":"好"}
